{"synopsis":"Ghislain Perdium sang Mercenary King dan salah satu orang terkuat di benua memulai perang untuk membalaskan dendam keluarganya\nRencana balas dendamnya berjalan dengan lancar sampai dia dihabisi oleh Idun yang tidak disangkasangka malah muncul Ghislain mengira bahwa dia sudah mati namun kembali bangun sebagai dirinya yang masih muda sebelum keluarganya runtuh\nDengan kesempatan kedua ini dia memutuskan untuk memperbaiki semua kepingan puzzle yang salah dan menghindari kesalahankesalahan di kehidupan sebelumnya","alternative_title":"회귀한 용병은 다 계획이 있다","author":"Gold Line","artist":"Park JinSeok","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"f90ffb6b-1167-4b05-ae05-3f4b870d63e2","number":"99","chapter":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"1f85fbd9-fb8e-465e-bcbb-13fdc250a537","number":"98","chapter":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-07-20","released":"2026-07-20","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"39c466d6-3867-465d-b69f-c7c4a57ae96f","number":"97","chapter":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"bd8d2ff2-ae85-4b05-a009-5755cc3bc8ac","number":"96","chapter":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f786bf6f-126c-4d86-9302-a41094701c14","number":"95","chapter":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-06-30","released":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"68e7feb5-84c6-4eeb-a29b-3da028e3dd28","number":"94","chapter":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"eb104bce-02c6-45cc-b38d-88e466dc5a52","number":"93","chapter":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-06-16","released":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e83a8724-7fc5-4c2e-a0b3-6b88295cf30e","number":"92","chapter":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"3a998034-7903-4664-8751-df71d1fb67e1","number":"91","chapter":"91","title":"Cha